From: Matthias Goergens <matthias.goergens@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 16:25:29 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Add an unused function before the client, a layout control

The same program as main with its code placed differently, to measure how
much the placement alone moves a benchmark.
---
 LeanHttp/Client.lean | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/LeanHttp/Client.lean b/LeanHttp/Client.lean
index b366363..4083f45 100644
--- a/LeanHttp/Client.lean
+++ b/LeanHttp/Client.lean
@@ -232,6 +232,9 @@ structure Client where
 
 namespace Client
 
+/-- Unused: moves the code that follows. -/
+def layoutPad (n : Nat) : Nat := (List.range n).foldl (fun a b => a * 31 + b * b + 7) 3
+
 /--
 The pool core's limits for `config`.
 -/
